{"id":71355,"date":"2026-10-29T19:34:45","date_gmt":"2026-10-29T19:34:45","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=71355"},"modified":"2026-10-29T20:36:17","modified_gmt":"2026-10-29T19:36:17","slug":"trail-costa-norte-by-adsp","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-costa-norte-by-adsp\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail Costa Norte by ADSP 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail Costa Norte by ADSP 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Trail Costa Norte by ADSP 2027<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>13 de Fevereiro de 2027<\/strong> (S\u00e1bado), com in\u00edcio marcado para as <strong>09:00<\/strong> na <strong>Ribeira Grande<\/strong>, ilha de S\u00e3o Miguel, nos <strong>A\u00e7ores<\/strong>. A prova percorre a vertente setentrional micaelense, proporcionando uma jornada de corrida em natureza entre fal\u00e9sias atl\u00e2nticas e trilhos vulc\u00e2nicos.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa desportivo integra tr\u00eas vertentes: <strong>TCN Trail Sprint<\/strong>, <strong>TCN Mini-Trail<\/strong> e <strong>TCN Caminhada<\/strong>. Os percursos desenvolvem-se ao longo da emblem\u00e1tica costa norte do concelho da Ribeira Grande, recortada por ribeiras, moinhos de \u00e1gua, miradouros sobre o Atl\u00e2ntico e a vegeta\u00e7\u00e3o end\u00e9mica que liga o litoral \u00e0s encostas do maci\u00e7o do Fogo.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o est\u00e1 a cargo da <strong>ADSP<\/strong>, assegurando a marca\u00e7\u00e3o integral dos trilhos e o enquadramento log\u00edstico dos atletas na ilha de S\u00e3o Miguel. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data & Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; 