D5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, dia 13 de Fevereiro de 2027, com partida agendada para as 09:00 no concelho da Ribeira Grande, ilha de S\u00e3o Miguel, A\u00e7ores.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as provas e segmentos dispon\u00edveis?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa \u00e9 composto por tr\u00eas vertentes: TCN Trail Sprint, TCN Mini-Trail e TCN Caminhada.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os valores de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e a data-limite de pagamento?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os valores s\u00e3o de 22,00 \u20ac para o TCN Trail Sprint, 17,00 \u20ac para o TCN Mini-Trail e 17,00 \u20ac para a TCN Caminhada (acompanhantes: 10,00 \u20ac), com pagamentos aceites at\u00e9 8 de fevereiro de 2027 \u00e0s 23:59.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem \u00e9 a entidade respons\u00e1vel pela organiza\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento \u00e9 organizado pela ADSP (contacto telef\u00f3nico oficial: 916 831 044).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso consultar o regulamento e dist\u00e2ncias exatas?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A data (13 de fevereiro de 2027), o hor\u00e1rio (09:00), os segmentos e os pre\u00e7os j\u00e1 se encontram confirmados; o regulamento detalhado e os tracks ser\u00e3o disponibilizados pela organiza\u00e7\u00e3o junto ao canal de inscri\u00e7\u00f5es.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trail Costa Norte by ADSP 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-02-13\", \"endDate\": \"2027-02-13\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Ribeira Grande, A\u00e7ores\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Ribeira Grande\", \"addressRegion\": \"A\u00e7ores\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O Trail Costa Norte by ADSP 2027 realiza-se a 13 de fevereiro na Ribeira Grande, S\u00e3o Miguel (A\u00e7ores). Provas Trail Sprint, Mini-Trail e Caminhada. Inscreve-te!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/trail-costa-norte-by-adsp-2026.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"TCN Trail Sprint\", \"price\": \"22.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InSto